      "created": 1791219041072,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NON FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\nLow Latency <(500ms)\nGuarantee delivery message\nBillions of User (high throughput)\nMessage Not store unnecessarily\nFault tolerance ",
